                                                "sense_id": "143dab8f-2bd3-3723-b94e-2981250d3aeb",
                                                "text": "And according to Hughes, HM Treasury is still sceptical about rail electrification. \"It's not because they don't see electrification as a good thing, but I think when you look at it from the UK-wide perspective, if you have £x billion to spend on decarbonisation, you don't necessarily start with rail. Rail's not where you get the biggest bang for the buck in terms of decarbonisation.\""
